{"id":"ce_re_monie","lemma":"cérémonie","pos":"noun","rank":1659,"glosses":["ceremony"],"ipa":"/se.ʁe.mɔ.ni/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Fr-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie.ogg/Fr-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9monie.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"cérémonies"},"formAudio":{"cérémonies":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Totodu74-c%C3%A9r%C3%A9monies.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La cérémonie aura lieu demain.","en":"The ceremony will take place tomorrow.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"tomorrow"}]},{"text":"C'est un homme qui adore les cérémonies.","en":"He is a man who loves ceremonies.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"La cérémonie était impressionnante.","en":"The ceremony was impressive.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"impressive","l":"impressionnant"}]},{"text":"C'était une belle cérémonie de mariage.","en":"It was a beautiful wedding ceremony.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"marriage"}]},{"text":"La cérémonie débuta par son discours.","en":"The ceremony began with his speech.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to start","l":"débuter"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"speech"}]}]}